[response 5]
thought: The bug is in checkout.py: it applies the coupon percent to line items via subtotal_after_coupon, then applies the same percent again via discount_amount on the full subtotal. The fix is to use only the per-item discounted subtotal and drop the second discount, keeping the promotional exemption and rounding intact.
action: edit_file src/checkout.py

